New file DartSectorPoint.lean supplying the three GAP pieces the concrete
EdmondsCompatible instantiation (edmondsCompatibleAtPrefix) needs:

1. dartSectorPoint — dart → off-vertex sector point in the drawing complement,
   built by Classical.choose from the single isolated existence obligation
   exists_dartSectorPoint.
2. dartSectorPoint_mem_drawingComplementIn — membership lemma (Classical.choose_spec),
   plus dartSectorRegion / dartSectorRegion_hcomp packaging the hcomp witness shape.
3. straightPolyArc / arcToPolyArc — straight graph arc → one-segment PolyArc;
   proved sorry-free (no-self-crossing fields vacuous at numSegs = 1, distinct
   reduces to endpoints distinct via endpoints_ne_of_arcsJoinEndpoints).

The single genuine plane-geometry fact not yet in the codebase — a small angular
wedge at a drawing vertex misses the finite arc union — is isolated as the private
lemma exists_dartSectorPoint with a {{NEEDS_PROOF}} flag; everything else is green.

